<\/p>","button_url":"","button_text":""}},"item_VnGLHf":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Merach_Brand_Story_6.jpg","image_rotation_degrees":1.5,"subheading":"Rowing for a Fitter Life","title":"2022-2023","content":"<p>The Q1S rowing machine, known for its ultra-quiet performance, compact design, and precise engineering, quickly gained popularity in the European market, particularly in Germany. Over the years, we have meticulously focused on enhancing product performance, continuously refining our designs based on customer feedback. This dedication led to the creation of Q1S with MERACH Go Tech, 950 with a Dual Resistance System, and R17 with a 45° angled water tank, each delivering a superior rowing experience.<\/p>","button_url":"","button_text":""}},"item_mwgN7V":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/R15_Pro_Merach_Magnetisches_Rudergerate_7_3381b976-1891-415c-8a20-82f07428e322.jpg","image_rotation_degrees":1.5,"subheading":"Bringing Nature To Home","title":"2024","content":"<p>Experience the Outdoors from Your Living Room with the Merach App!<br\/>The Merach App brings the beauty of nature into your home with realistic 3D maps and immersive outdoor scenarios. Whether you're rowing, cycling, or running, you'll feel as if you're gliding through breathtaking landscapes, making your workout more engaging and motivating. Step into a virtual outdoor world and transform your home fitness routine into an adventurous and immersive experience.<\/p>","button_url":"","button_text":""}}},"block_order":["item_GbHmri","item_VnGLHf","item_mwgN7V"],"settings":{"full_width":true,"images_layout":"stacked","collage_images_alignment":"middle","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":"","button_background":"","button_text_color":""}},"slideshow_MeV6WY":{"type":"slideshow","blocks":{"image_adnhzB":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/merach_versprechen.jpg","content_max_width":780,"mobile_text_posi